{"id":2092,"name":"LKSV4","path":"/e-form/2118f944-5f3a-4dca-9fdb-99cd73b1cff2","fetchedAt":"2026-09-26T14:45:23.336Z","html":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>NỘI DUNG MẪU HỘ TỊCH ĐIỆN TỬ TƯƠNG TÁC ĐĂNG KÝ LẠI KHAI SINH</strong></p><p><strong>I. Thông tin về người yêu cầu đăng ký khai sinh &nbsp;</strong></p><p>(1) Họ, chữ đệm, tên: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[HoVaTenC]]\" uid=\"e01d876d1e5b9108fd378f7bc8c60ab3f\" uuid=\"4bb97b2e-65d4-4d8c-8f57-517c602d6209\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"HoVaTenC\">[[HoVaTenC]]</span></p><p>(2) Số định danh cá nhân: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[SoDinhDanhC]]\" uid=\"eb10e5b1addbe1e604badff2c7e7b2ffc\" uuid=\"75fd6730-0580-4d16-928f-aadde5535435\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"SoDinhDanhC\">[[SoDinhDanhC]]</span></p><p>(3) Giấy tờ tùy thân: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[LoaiGiayToDinhDanhC]]\" uid=\"ed2b00231a3d140f5f375c735760d581a\" uuid=\"05143be7-7a3c-4c3a-9a3f-53bc2c4738f7\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"LoaiGiayToDinhDanhC\">[[LoaiGiayToDinhDanhC]]</span><span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[nycTenGiayTo]]\" uid=\"e2dde72de5cc2ce864547abbda9ad1f84\" uuid=\"57f52929-f733-4d88-a8ae-500e831587dc\" type=\"x-select-area\" name=\"nycTenGiayTo\">[[nycTenGiayTo]]</span> số: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[SoGiayToDinhDanhC]]\" uid=\"e1ba535113fa81b705bdfb8b0e4c486a0\" uuid=\"431ae815-5b16-4356-a555-ee42b1340cb0\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"SoGiayToDinhDanhC\">[[SoGiayToDinhDanhC]]</span></p><p>Ngày, tháng, năm cấp: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NgayCapDDC]]\" uid=\"e079def01e4b0b5eb9d2a1f6fe3dd25f1\" uuid=\"dbba2469-840f-4030-bcc4-ae6174b436fe\" type=\"x-date\" name=\"NgayCapDDC\">[[NgayCapDDC]]</span> &nbsp;Cơ quan cấp:<span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NoiCapDDC]]\" uid=\"e1eb48710c9d9f7118d9225168b4860f7\" uuid=\"b2f30d8f-4b87-4621-89a0-8bb4e75825df\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"NoiCapDDC\">[[NoiCapDDC]]</span></p><p>(4) Loại cư trú: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[nycLoaiCuTru]]\" uid=\"e8ecce26b7205960eeefab5fb86c22126\" uuid=\"b4b19168-d199-490a-be03-4e367d29cfdc\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"nycLoaiCuTru\">[[nycLoaiCuTru]]</span>&nbsp;</p><p>Nơi cư trú (nơi thường trú/nơi tạm trú/nơi đang sinh sống):<span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[nycNoiCuTru]]\" uid=\"e5166e1b257e330d15c1ccdf640a04879\" uuid=\"656124af-e5c9-4f6f-8374-2cf9b6b71fbf\" type=\"x-radio\" name=\"nycNoiCuTru\">[[nycNoiCuTru]]</span>&nbsp;</p><p><span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[nycNoiCuTru_TrongNuoc]]\" uid=\"e4110ad505d36d2b6e6b0a48563e4039d\" uuid=\"60c11d2f-099b-4c86-a1ee-c6e25f98c7a3\" type=\"x-select-area\" name=\"nycNoiCuTru_TrongNuoc\">[[nycNoiCuTru_TrongNuoc]]</span> <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[nycNoiCuTru_NuocNgoai]]\" uid=\"eebe559a2264002c775ae071b4c214d48\" uuid=\"5f2a6314-8944-438f-830b-4d2c0543d190\" type=\"x-select-area\" name=\"nycNoiCuTru_NuocNgoai\">[[nycNoiCuTru_NuocNgoai]]</span></p><p>(5) Quan hệ với người được khai sinh: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[QuanHe]]\" uid=\"e1aaab8e1f21ba7af7d9c99e06821753a\" uuid=\"6ccb2362-2fac-457a-a3fa-66555560061b\" type=\"x-radio\" name=\"QuanHe\">[[QuanHe]]</span></p><p><strong>II. Thông tin về người được đăng ký khai sinh&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Loại đăng ký: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[LoaiDangKy]]\" uid=\"e2d79f098f727df99c90bcf9da37d3100\" uuid=\"cdf9c7b7-9506-4527-a38a-79b2709cb0bf\" type=\"x-radio\" name=\"LoaiDangKy\">[[LoaiDangKy]]</span></p><p>Cơ quan đăng ký hộ tịch trước đây: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[coQuanDKTruocDay_filter]]\" uid=\"e0cbce87cc5fcf3b2e4b6952db2abd721\" uuid=\"ef9627a2-8578-4ba6-a143-97867f98c4c6\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"coQuanDKTruocDay_filter\">[[coQuanDKTruocDay_filter]]</span><span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[coQuanDKTruocDay]]\" uid=\"e978b7b4202fa7444c085f22d32bf36e8\" uuid=\"29dcfc65-e881-4f4d-800e-57b74d77b4e8\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"coQuanDKTruocDay\">[[coQuanDKTruocDay]]</span></p><p>Số đăng ký khai sinh trước đây: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[soDKTruocDay]]\" uid=\"efdd1b09a51f7a7563d6c85cd055d164f\" uuid=\"4dd3834c-79fd-49c9-985c-974323cdf384\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"soDKTruocDay\">[[soDKTruocDay]]</span> Quyển số đăng ký khai sinh trước đây: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[quyenSoDKTruocDay]]\" uid=\"e0f927de04368a70e91e9e22500fe8f79\" uuid=\"ce650b2f-c6c1-4a0c-bf86-e4e4699c615a\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"quyenSoDKTruocDay\">[[quyenSoDKTruocDay]]</span></p><p>Ngày đăng ký khai sinh trước đây: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[ngayDKTruocDay]]\" uid=\"ebb954e7f874b1c0676e0d8b4d0adb2f2\" uuid=\"2164263f-7b65-4416-b0d8-7e21f982adca\" type=\"x-date-text\" name=\"ngayDKTruocDay\">[[ngayDKTruocDay]]</span> Loại khai sinh: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[nksLoaiKhaiSinh]]\" uid=\"e2e7b9289949e5f9d79eefcb8d3d81c55\" uuid=\"650e2a4f-c507-4b81-b0bd-740b1fae110e\" type=\"x-select-default\" name=\"nksLoaiKhaiSinh\">[[nksLoaiKhaiSinh]]</span></p><p>(6) Họ, chữ đệm, tên: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[HoTenKS]]\" uid=\"ef6dc25cf73a205f036173da4679498f1\" uuid=\"22974671-0349-4360-adc1-25a7e5dc59ee\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"HoTenKS\">[[HoTenKS]]</span></p><p>(7) Ngày, tháng, năm sinh: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NgaySinhChon]]\" uid=\"ebc872c728d50302d5350f49c9e1723db\" uuid=\"f1fb954f-6cef-4c18-947a-53b24d0c3a0c\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"NgaySinhChon\">[[NgaySinhChon]]</span> Bằng chữ:<span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[DocNgaySinh]]\" uid=\"e12c40d102c2366454d62981ff67f1f81\" uuid=\"e4cc0b64-d698-4a36-914d-575277e06179\" type=\"x-date-text-vn\" name=\"DocNgaySinh\">[[DocNgaySinh]]</span></p><p>(8) Giới tính: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[GioiTinhKS]]\" uid=\"e75472c391efe26bba7c4523d82cd8372\" uuid=\"2f861682-c4c1-451d-97e7-2471017d2895\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"GioiTinhKS\">[[GioiTinhKS]]</span> (9) Dân tộc: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[DanTocKS]]\" uid=\"ec1339de88bb051b3d55bebea3b84ba7b\" uuid=\"140b3662-9afc-45bb-aedc-364f7f342a63\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"DanTocKS\">[[DanTocKS]]</span><span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[nksDanTocKhac]]\" uid=\"ede3e8976b6f53b20d8f79b3a78c6574f\" uuid=\"7903cb7f-3865-452b-8ac0-e66c1550df41\" 